       "Area $S=\\pi r^2$, circumference $C=2\\pi r$",
       "$r=6$: $S=36\\pi$, $C=12\\pi$"
      ],
      [
       "Given $S$ or $C$? Go back to $r$ first",
       "$S=49\\pi\\Rightarrow r=7$"
      ],
      [
       "Arc and sector: the part of the circle, $\\frac{\\alpha}{360°}$",
       "$90°=\\frac14,\\ 60°=\\frac16,\\ 72°=\\frac15,\\ 45°=\\frac18,\\ 120°=\\frac13$"
      ],
      [
       "Sector perimeter $=$ arc $+\\,2r$",
       "$r=6,\\ 60°$: $2\\pi+12$"
      ],
      [
       "$r\\times k$: lengths $\\times k$, areas $\\times k^2$",
       "$r\\times3\\Rightarrow$ area $\\times9$"
      ],
